  "releaseNotes": "- RSActionMonitor =>\n\t\t  - Added optional forceTag support to Action Monitor async methods to allow targeted logging for specific flows.\n\t\t  - Added support for HTTP-based request logging (SendJsonRequestHttpAsync) with the same tag-based force-send behavior.\n\t\t  - Added tag filtering logic with cached force-send tag list (HashSet) for low-overhead checks.\n\t\t  - Added support for enabling/disabling force-send by tag via configuration (ACTION_MONITOR_FORCE_SEND_TAGS_ENABLE).\n\t\t  - Refactored duplicated database logging code into a private shared flow (SaveActionMonitorToDatabaseAsync) to centralize persistence and error handling.\n\t\t  - Improved request log metadata by including force-tag diagnostic information (ForceTag, feature enabled, and force-send applied).\n\t\t  - IRSActionMonitor =>\n\t\t  - Updated async method signatures to support optional forceTag.\n\t\t  - Added HTTP request logging contract (SendJsonRequestHttpAsync) with optional forceTag support.\n\t\t  - RSAppSettings  =>\n\t\t  - Added configuration support for Action Monitor force-send tags and feature enable flag (ACTION_MONITOR_FORCE_SEND_TAGS, ACTION_MONITOR_FORCE_SEND_TAGS_ENABLE).\n\t\t  - Nuget package update.",
